{"id":"83377a9723d63a92","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound.md","title":"完美保密的密钥空间下界","display":"thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound — 完美保密的密钥空间下界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound","aliases":["28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound"],"display":"thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound — 完美保密的密钥空间下界","depends_on":["[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §9.1 and Exercise 9.2","source_printed_pages":"175,197","source_pdf_pages":"201,223","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound — 完美保密的密钥空间下界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"05773b5ac46bc2b8\" href=\"?note=05773b5ac46bc2b8\" title=\"28-df-perfect-secrecy\">28-df-perfect-secrecy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §9.1 and Exercise 9.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"175,197"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"201,223"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D\">\\(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D\\)</span> 具有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"05773b5ac46bc2b8\" href=\"?note=05773b5ac46bc2b8\" title=\"28-df-perfect-secrecy\">28-df-perfect-secrecy</a> 的类型和非空有限性条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D)\\Longrightarrow|\\mathcal K|\\ge|\\mathcal M|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D)\\Longrightarrow|\\mathcal K|\\ge|\\mathcal M|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定一对k₀,m₀并令y=E(k₀,m₀)。分布相同保证每个m都存在k_m使E(k_m,m)=y。若k_m=k_m'，正确解密同一(k,y)会给出m=m'，所以这些密钥互异，得到M到K的单射。特别地n位均匀密钥与m位明文要求2<sup>n≥2</sup>m，即n≥m。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§9.1 and Exercise 9.2；印刷 pp.175,197 / PDF pp.201,223。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-perfect-secrecy","status":"resolved","id":"05773b5ac46bc2b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-perfect-secrecy","status":"resolved","id":"05773b5ac46bc2b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D$ 具有 [[28-df-perfect-secrecy]] 的类型和非空有限性条件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal C,E,D)\\Longrightarrow|\\mathcal K|\\ge|\\mathcal M|.","display":true}],"bytes":1434,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-315","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]、[[28-ex-one-time-pad]]、[[28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound]]、[[28-df-one-way-permutation]]、[[28-thm-ggm-prf]]、[[28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse]]。"}],"outgoing":["05773b5ac46bc2b8"]}